.TH fortune 1 "FUZIX Games" "FUZIX"
.SH NAME
fortune \- print a random saying
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fortune
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fortune
prints one saying, picked at random from a collection of 1,056.  It
takes no arguments.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /usr/games/fortune.dat
The sayings, with an index at the front so that one can be found
without reading the rest.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cowsay (1)
